        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala EJAKAIT Musa ebc, “Koloma mama ejai Parao, kolimok ebe, ‘Ebala EJAKAIT kwanata ebe, “Kisiik ikatuŋa alosit, teterc kejaanakinete eoŋ. ",
