            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema EJAKAIT Musa atiar, “Konyou tupuruc sek kobwo kakonyen nuka Parao; koany, elomuni alosit akipi; kolimok ŋes ebe, ‘Ebala EJAKAIT kwanata ebe, “Kisiik ikatuŋa alosit, tetere kejaanakinete eoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye arai mam isiikini ikatuŋa alosit, koany, ejukuni icuc luipu noi mamakon, ka neejaas ikonikejaanakinak, ka neejaas ikonituŋa, toma otogoikon da: ilelebunos ieuc luipu noi otogoi luka Imisirian, akwap da naejaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
