          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Musa atiar, “Mam ibusakinit aswam kwaŋin; naarai kijaikini luitaleete Imisirian mama ejai EJAKAIT Ekosideke: koany, kiinakini kereka luitaleete Imisirian kakonyenekec, komam kibiribirete sio kamor? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
